/-! Real TOP data for a finite-difference Bernstein checker benchmark.

For normalized degree-n Bernstein data p, the power coefficient of degree a
is `choose n a * forwardDifference^[a] p 0`.  This fixture authenticates the
first 23 z-difference heads, proves the entire 23rd difference row is zero,
then checks all 48 by 23 mixed power coefficients by c-differences.  It uses
only integer subtraction/multiplication and ordinary kernel reduction. -/

